  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.9.0: Profile property on all registration attributes — [Scoped(Profile = \"production\")] + AddAutoWireServices(profile: \"production\") for environment-specific registration. Updated icon. 1.8.0: Ordered decorator stacking via Order property. 1.7.0: AW004 captive dependency diagnostic. 1.6.0: IncludeSelf = true. 1.5.0: [HostedService] + AW003. 1.4.0: Decorators. 1.3.0: AllowMultiple, DuplicateStrategy, TryX. 1.2.0: Open generics. 1.0.0: Initial release.",
